                <pb facs="0836" n="724" sameAs="frus:frus1919Russia/pg724"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">861.00/5404: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Commissioner at Helsingfors</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Haynes</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                        State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Helsingfors</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1919-10-16T15:00:00+01:39"><hi rendition="#italic">October 16,
                                1919—3 p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received October 17, 1:43
                        a.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>465. Reported Gatchina taken by Northwestern Army and Petrograd likely to fall in
                    few days.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Haynes</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
